{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o021d","title":"曹仁攻句阳获吕布将刘何","accounts":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o021d-account","label":"《诸夏侯曹传第九》正文","text":"曹仁攻句阳获吕布将刘何","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o021d-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-ren","role":"攻城获将","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o021d-q"]},{"person":"xiahoucao-p0033","role":"被获","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o021d-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"曹仁从曹操起兵后","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o021d-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"xiahoucao-e-o021d-q","source_order":[9,106,"O021d"],"order":2177}],"persons":[{"id":"xiahoucao-p0033","name":"刘何","evidence":["xiahoucao-q-o021"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"xiahoucao-m-o021-xiahoucao-p0033","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xiahoucao-q-o021"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o021d-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-71cd402e9199d43761f6","layer":"original","quote":"太祖征吕布，仁别攻句阳〖5〗，拔之，生获布将刘何。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":105,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":158,"end":183},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o021","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-71cd402e9199d43761f6","layer":"original","quote":"曹仁字子孝。太祖从弟也。﹝一﹞少好弓马弋猎。后豪杰并起，仁亦阴结少年，得千余人。周旅淮、泗之间〖1〗，遂从太祖，为别部司马，行厉锋校尉〖2〗。太祖之破袁术，仁所斩获颇多。从征徐州，仁常督骑〖3〗，为军前锋；别攻陶谦将吕由，破之。还，与大军合彭城，大破谦军。从攻费、华、即墨、开阳〖4〗，谦遣别将救诸县，仁以骑击破之。太祖征吕布，仁别攻句阳〖5〗，拔之，生获布将刘何。太祖平黄巾，迎天子都许；仁数有功，拜广阳太守〖6〗。太祖器其勇略，不使之郡〖7〗，以议郎督骑。太祖征张绣，仁别徇旁县〖8〗，虏其男女三千余人。太祖军还，为绣所追；军不利，士卒丧气。仁率厉将士甚奋，太祖壮之，遂破绣。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":105,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":290}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
